<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer [Cruise Control System]</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The engine control computer connector is a waterproof connector, so the voltage of each terminal cannot be inspected and oscilloscope waveforms cannot be checked with it installed on the vehicle.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check the engine control computer operation and communication establishment using the data monitor and Active Test with the SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064E00IX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
